================================================================
== HW Interfaces
================================================================
* S_AXILITE Interfaces
+---------------+------------+---------------+--------+----------+
| Interface     | Data Width | Address Width | Offset | Register |
+---------------+------------+---------------+--------+----------+
| s_axi_control | 32         | 8             | 16     | 0        |
+---------------+------------+---------------+--------+----------+

* S_AXILITE Registers
+---------------+--------------------------------+--------+-------+--------+-----------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| Interface     | Register                       | Offset | Width | Access | Description                                   | Bit Fields                                                                         |
+---------------+--------------------------------+--------+-------+--------+-----------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| s_axi_control | CTRL                           | 0x00   | 32    | RW     | Control signals                               | 0=AP_START 1=AP_DONE 2=AP_IDLE 3=AP_READY 4=AP_CONTINUE 7=AUTO_RESTART 9=INTERRUPT |
| s_axi_control | GIER                           | 0x04   | 32    | RW     | Global Interrupt Enable Register              | 0=Enable                                                                           |
| s_axi_control | IP_IER                         | 0x08   | 32    | RW     | IP Interrupt Enable Register                  | 0=CHAN0_INT_EN 1=CHAN1_INT_EN                                                      |
| s_axi_control | IP_ISR                         | 0x0c   | 32    | RW     | IP Interrupt Status Register                  | 0=CHAN0_INT_ST 1=CHAN1_INT_ST                                                      |
| s_axi_control | slr_region                     | 0x10   | 32    | W      | Data signal of slr_region                     |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | outer_itr                      | 0x18   | 32    | W      | Data signal of outer_itr                      |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_grid_size_0      | 0x20   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_grid_size_0      |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_grid_size_1      | 0x28   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_grid_size_1      |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_grid_size_2      | 0x30   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_grid_size_2      |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_dim              | 0x38   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_dim              |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_total_itr        | 0x40   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_total_itr        |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_lower_limit_0    | 0x48   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_lower_limit_0    |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_lower_limit_1    | 0x50   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_lower_limit_1    |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_lower_limit_2    | 0x58   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_lower_limit_2    |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_upper_limit_0    | 0x60   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_upper_limit_0    |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_upper_limit_1    | 0x68   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_upper_limit_1    |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_upper_limit_2    | 0x70   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_upper_limit_2    |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_outer_loop_limit | 0x78   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_outer_loop_limit |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_batch_size       | 0x80   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_batch_size       |                                                                                    |
+---------------+--------------------------------+--------+-------+--------+-----------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+

* AXIS
+---------------+---------------+-------+-------+-------+--------+-------+--------+
| Interface     | Register Mode | TDATA | TKEEP | TLAST | TREADY | TSTRB | TVALID |
+---------------+---------------+-------+-------+-------+--------+-------+--------+
| arg0_axis_in  | both          | 256   | 32    | 1     | 1      | 32    | 1      |
| arg1_axis_out | both          | 256   | 32    | 1     | 1      | 32    | 1      |
+---------------+---------------+-------+-------+-------+--------+-------+--------+

